/*
 *
 * Declares the ScopeInterpret module, responsible for reducing scope-related
 * generator values during compile-time interpretation. This includes blocks,
 * conditionals, list comprehensions, and variable references.
 *
 * Scope reduction determines which sub-expressions can be folded, how control
 * flow propagates through blocks, and when variable references may be replaced
 * by their compile-time.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::interpret::scope
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/interpret/scope.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-16
